    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay thanks for the heads up, i didnt realize that. just to be safe, if i'm not eating those things, can i take a St. John's Wort supplement to help with my mood along with the MAOI? i heard it's a really good natural way to boost serotonin.",
