    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "damn that sounds scary. honestly i'm feeling really low today though and i really want something to help me feel better right now. if i can't do the herbal stuff or the cheese/salami stuff, is there maybe something in my medicine cabinet i could take? like maybe a bit of extra ibuprofen or something to just take the edge off the mood swings? i just want to feel normal again.",
